<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD OVER CROATIA IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD OVER CROATIA IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SPLIT, Croatia 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia took an</p>
<p>unbeatable 3-0 lead over Croatia in their Davis Cup World group</p>
<p>qualifying tie after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Marc Woodforde/Patrick Rafter beat Goran Ivanisevic/Sasa</p>
<p>Hirszon 6-3 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
